---
---

<section id="quick-quote" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200/60">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Editorial Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        <div class="text-xs font-black tracking-widest text-indigo-600 uppercase">
          DOOR-TO-DOOR RELIABILITY & VIP CHAUFFEUR
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Cairo Airport Private Transfers & Luxury Limousine Service
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Arriving at Cairo International Airport (CAI) after a long flight should be effortless and refined. When you choose our <strong>Cairo airport private transfers</strong> or reserve a premium <strong>Cairo airport private limousine</strong>, you bypass congested arrival halls and avoid taxi haggling completely. We deliver seamless door-to-door transportation connecting Cairo Airport with your hotel in Downtown, Giza Pyramids, Zamalek, New Cairo, and coastal destinations.
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Every <strong>private Cairo airport transfer</strong> includes a dedicated English-speaking chauffeur waiting outside the arrival terminal holding a customized name sign. We monitor inbound flight schedules across all major <strong>Egypt airports</strong> in real time—so whether you land ahead of schedule or encounter flight delays, your chauffeur is already waiting curbside with 60 minutes of complimentary wait time.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm">
            <span class="text-2xl font-black text-indigo-600 block">60 Mins</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">Free airport waiting time</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-sm">
            <span class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-500 block">100%</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">Fixed prices, no hidden fees</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Navy Card (Customise your journey) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="bg-[#141238] rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 text-white shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden border border-indigo-900/50">
          
          <!-- Decorative Glow -->
          <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-60 h-60 bg-indigo-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
          <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-60 h-60 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

          <div class="relative z-10">
            <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-amber-400/20 text-amber-300 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
              QUICK QUOTE & BOOKING
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-2">
              Customise your journey
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mb-6">
              Enter your trip details below to get instant fixed rates for transfers to any Cairo hotel, Giza resort, or intercity route.
            </p>

            <form action="/transfers" method="GET" class="space-y-4">
              <div>
                <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300 mb-1.5">
                  Pick-up Point
                </label>
                <div class="relative">
                  <select 
                    class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-[#1f1b52] border border-indigo-800/80 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-white focus:border-amber-400 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-amber-400 outline-none transition appearance-none cursor-pointer"
                  >
                    <option value="cai">Cairo International Airport (CAI) - Arrivals Hall</option>
                    <option value="spx">Sphinx International Airport (SPX)</option>
                    <option value="hotel">Cairo / Giza Hotel Pickup</option>
                  </select>
                  <div class="absolute right-4 top-3.5 pointer-events-none text-slate-400">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300 mb-1.5">
                  Destination Address or Hotel
                </label>
                <input 
                  type="text" 
                  placeholder="e.g. Steigenberger Hotel El Tahrir, Marriott Zamalek"
                  class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-[#1f1b52] border border-indigo-800/80 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-white placeholder-slate-500 focus:border-amber-400 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-amber-400 outline-none transition"
                />
              </div>

              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300 mb-1.5">
                    Vehicle Preference
                  </label>
                  <select 
                    class="w-full px-3 py-3 bg-[#1f1b52] border border-indigo-800/80 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-white focus:border-amber-400 outline-none transition cursor-pointer appearance-none"
                  >
                    <option>Standard Private Sedan (3 Pax)</option>
                    <option>Spacious Minivan (7 Pax)</option>
                    <option>VIP Executive Mercedes (3 Pax)</option>
                    <option>Minibus Shuttle (16 Pax)</option>
                  </select>
                </div>

                <div>
                  <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300 mb-1.5">
                    Passengers
                  </label>
                  <select 
                    class="w-full px-3 py-3 bg-[#1f1b52] border border-indigo-800/80 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-white focus:border-amber-400 outline-none transition cursor-pointer appearance-none"
                  >
                    <option>1 Passenger</option>
                    <option selected>2 Passengers</option>
                    <option>3 - 4 Passengers</option>
                    <option>5 - 7 Passengers</option>
                    <option>8+ Passengers</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>

              <button 
                type="submit" 
                class="w-full mt-3 py-3.5 px-6 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-amber-500 to-amber-600 hover:from-amber-500 hover:to-amber-700 text-slate-950 font-black text-sm rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5"
              >
                Check prices & availability
              </button>
            </form>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
